a:[["$","$L15",null,{"project":{"slug":"ror","title":"ROR Tobacco","category":null,"thumbnail":"/images/work/ror/thumb.jpg","summary":"ROR Tobacco wanted SPEAKERHEAD to help transform his tobacco company and bring it to the California market with a bang. We revolutionized his vision by merging the metaverse with his tobacco, creating a sensation-packed experience that dominated the California market. SPEAKERHEAD utilized 3D animation and innovative branding to skyrocket their presence.","images":["/images/work/ror/img-1.jpg"],"videoUrl":null,"blocks":[{"heading":"Approach","text":"SPEAKERHEAD prioritized elevating their online presence and revolutionizing the tobacco experience, and we took the reins to make it extraordinary. We crafted a branding strategy that blew minds and left competitors in the dust. Through jaw-dropping 3D animation and awe-inspiring branding strategies, we breathed new life into every aspect of their online presentations.","image":"/images/work/ror/img-2.jpg","imageWidth":2000,"imageHeight":1500,"imageSide":"left"},{"type":"video-gallery","videos":[{"poster":"/images/work/ror/img-4.jpg","videoUrl":"https://res.cloudinary.com/peofyacs/video/upload/v1786114271/Ror-video-1_lvu9ux.mp4","alt":"ROR Tobacco promo video still 1"},{"poster":"/images/work/ror/img-3.jpg","videoUrl":"https://res.cloudinary.com/peofyacs/video/upload/v1786114275/Ror-video-2_dqh172.mp4","alt":"ROR Tobacco promo video still 2"},{"poster":"/images/work/ror/img-5.jpg","videoUrl":"https://res.cloudinary.com/peofyacs/video/upload/v1786114234/Ror-video-3_mpuegf.mov","alt":"ROR Tobacco promo video still 3"},{"poster":"/images/work/ror/img-6.jpg","videoUrl":"https://res.cloudinary.com/peofyacs/video/upload/v1786114246/Ror-video-4_wif0hq.mp4","alt":"ROR Tobacco promo video still 4"},{"poster":"/images/work/ror/img-7.jpg","videoUrl":"https://res.cloudinary.com/peofyacs/video/upload/v1786114263/Ror-video-5_lqpw8q.mp4","alt":"ROR Tobacco promo video still 5"},{"poster":"/images/work/ror/img-8.jpg","videoUrl":"https://res.cloudinary.com/peofyacs/video/upload/v1786114229/Ror-video-6_sxyuba.mp4","alt":"ROR Tobacco promo video still 6"},{"poster":"/images/work/ror/img-9.jpg","videoUrl":"https://res.cloudinary.com/peofyacs/video/upload/v1786114300/Ror-video-7_fffkne.mp4","alt":"ROR Tobacco promo video still 7"}]},{"heading":"Website content","text":"By implementing cutting-edge techniques, we revolutionized their online presence. Our unrivaled creativity elevated their content to new heights, ensuring it was not only aesthetically pleasing but also effortlessly intuitive for users. Through mesmerizing visuals and captivating videos, we artfully showcased the exceptional quality and countless benefits of their remarkable tobacco products. Every frame of our video breathes authenticity, leaving no room for doubt that SPEAKERHEAD is an unequivocal force to be reckoned with.","image":"/images/work/ror/img-10.jpg","imageWidth":2000,"imageHeight":1333,"imageSide":"right"},{"heading":"Branding","text":"Our branding strategy was meticulously crafted to encapsulate the unparalleled taste and captivating experience unleashed by tobacco. Collaborating intimately with the senses, we birthed a brand identity that resonated with our esteemed audience. Behold, we fashioned an extraordinary logo that exudes an air of mystique, a color scheme that electrifies the senses, a 3D animation that mesmerizes the eyes, and harnessed the prowess of cutting-edge real engine technology. Our visual language serves as a radiant reflection of our cherished company values, elevating the tobacco industry to daring new heights.","image":"/images/work/ror/img-11.jpg","imageWidth":2000,"imageHeight":1334,"imageSide":"left"},{"heading":"Marketing","text":"To powerfully captivate the California market, we unleashed a magnificent marketing campaign to promote the awe-inspiring Tobacco products. Brace yourselves, because we harnessed the limitless potential of cutting-edge digital channels like social media, influential partnerships, and dazzling online advertising. Our mission was to entice the perfect audience and ignite their curiosity with the mesmerizing allure of our one-of-a-kind tobacco offerings, ultimately transforming their fascination into a resounding success story of skyrocketing sales. With SPEAKERHEAD, ROR took the journey to indefinite success!","image":"/images/work/ror/img-12.jpg","imageWidth":2000,"imageHeight":1333,"imageSide":"right"},{"heading":"Content Creation","text":"We harnessed the power of state-of-the-art content creation tools, such as the Unreal Engine, to produce truly remarkable and visually breathtaking content. By utilizing cutting-edge 3D visuals, we achieved the pinnacle of quality, providing an unparalleled viewing experience. Our team crafted captivating visuals, bringing them to life through realistic animations and immersive special effects, all aimed at enhancing the overall engagement of our audience.\n\nWe also placed great importance on delivering the highest standard of audio elements. Applying advanced sound engineering techniques, we ensured an impactful auditory journey packed with dynamic sound effects and carefully curated music. This meticulous attention to audio detail further elevated the sensory immersion, enriching and expanding the experience of smoke and soak.","image":"/images/work/ror/img-13.jpg","imageWidth":2000,"imageHeight":1333,"imageSide":"left"}]}}],"$L16"]
